# The project's own release line (bumped by hand when cutting a release, e.g.
# `git tag v$BASE_VERSION`). Agent-version-bump releases published by CI ride
# on top of this as v$BASE_VERSION+codex-<X>-claude-<Y>, so there is one
# linear tag lineage instead of two unrelated ones.
